WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.867
GAIN. Ice takes heat from warmer surroundings.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.144
MELT. The ice gradually turns into liquid water.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.803
LOSE. A warm drink loses heat and cools.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.357
COMPARE. Arrows show heat moving from warm towards cool.
